{"id":"07845482f0a2f378","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md","title":"正确标准 T 扩张中的理论可靠性等价","display":"thm-soundness-equivalence — 正确标准 T 扩张中的理论可靠性等价","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-soundness-equivalence","aliases":["91-thm-soundness-equivalence"],"display":"thm-soundness-equivalence — 正确标准 T 扩张中的理论可靠性等价","depends_on":["[[91-df-soundness-predicate]]","[[91-df-global-reflection]]","[[91-df-expressive-completeness]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-soundness-equivalence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-soundness-equivalence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-soundness-equivalence — 正确标准 T 扩张中的理论可靠性等价"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"acda8ebf92673c3d\" href=\"?note=acda8ebf92673c3d\" title=\"91-df-soundness-predicate\">91-df-soundness-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16b107dfee99998b\" href=\"?note=16b107dfee99998b\" title=\"91-df-global-reflection\">91-df-global-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ce2e952933d30cc2\" href=\"?note=ce2e952933d30cc2\" title=\"91-df-expressive-completeness\">91-df-expressive-completeness</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为可递归公理化的基础算术理论，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{Tr}}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N})\">\\(\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{Tr}}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N})\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(S)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(S)\\)</span> 为外部可靠性，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S)\\)</span> 为对象全局反射句，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_S\\)</span> 在标准模型中解释通常标准有限证明。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{Tr}}\\models\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{Tr}}\\models\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>右侧的对象公式使用新原始符号 T。原稿先把 True_N 定为元层代码集合，又在对象公式中把它直接当谓词符号，造成同名类型冲突，现统一为真正的 T 扩张。\n标准证明和正确 T 外延逐句展开即得等价。在非标准结构中 Pr_S 可收纳非标准“证明”，不能直接复制此论证；也不推出 S 在内部证明相应反射。</p>\n<p>来源：§8.6、Chapter 22；固定标准外延下的反射条件展开。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-soundness-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"acda8ebf92673c3d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-soundness-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-global-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-expressive-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"ce2e952933d30cc2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-expressive-completeness]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{Tr}}=(\\mathbb N,T\\mapsto\\mathrm{Tr}_{\\mathbb N})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}soundness\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{Sound}_{\\mathbb N}(S)\\Longleftrightarrow\\mathfrak N_{\\mathrm{Tr}}\\models\\mathrm{GRF}_T(S).","display":true}],"bytes":1466,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-148","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-153","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-soundness-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-stable-sentence-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-iteration-stability.md]]\n[[91-thm-truth-predicate-definability-hierarchy.md]]\n[[91-thm-tru